    "preamble": "T.Paul Pandian vs The Designated Officer on 6 February, 2024 Author: V.Bhavani Subbaroyan Bench: V.Bhavani Subbaroyan W.P.(M Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated : 06.02.2024 Coram The Hon'Ble Mrs Justice V.Bhavani Subbaroyan W.P.(MD)No.31335 of 2023 and W.M.P(MD)Nos.26888 & 26889 of 2023 T.Paul Pandian ... Petitioner Vs. 1.The Designated Officer, Tamilnadu Food Safety Wing, Kanyakumari District. 2.The Food Safety Officer, Agasteeswaram Block, Kanyakumari District. ... Respondents Prayer : Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution of India, Writ of Certiorarified Mandamus, calling for the records on the first respon pertaining to its impugned proceedings in Na.Ka.No.2524/A2/2023 dated 20.12. and to quash the same and consequently direct the respondents to de-seal the premises at Door No.16/73 A2, Ottayalvilai, Agasteeswaram Block, Kanyakumari District so as to enable the petitioner to continuing his business. For Petitioner : Mr.SC.Herold Singh For R1 & R2 : Mr.D.Gandhiraj Special Government Pleader ***** https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 1/3 T.Paul Pandian vs The Designated Officer on 6 February, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/165133307/ 1 W.P.(M ORDER",
